    "# !cd"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9c3feab2-387f-4f05-a59a-fbe6e0b31818",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Train Model Options:\n",
    "\n",
    "--model unet: Basic U-Net\\\n",
    "--model enhanced: Enhanced U-Net with residual blocks and dropout\\\n",
    "--model attention: Attention U-Net\n",
    "\n",
    "**Usage Examples:**\n",
    "\n",
    "## Basic U-Net training\n",
    "\n",
    "python3 train.py --model unet --loss_type combined --num_epochs 50\n",
    "\n",
    "## Enhanced U-Net with custom settings\n",
    "python3 train.py --model enhanced \\\n",
    "    --base_features 64 \\\n",
    "    --encoder_dropout 0.1 \\\n",
    "    --bottleneck_dropout 0.2 \\\n",
    "    --use_amp \\\n",
    "    --optimizer adamw\n",
    "\n",
    "## Attention U-Net with focal loss\n",
    "python3 train.py --model attention \\\n",
    "    --loss_type focal \\\n",
    "    --learning_rate 1e-4 \\\n",
    "    --scheduler_type cosine \\\n",
    "    --early_stopping \\\n",
    "    --gradient_clipping\n",
    "    \n",
    "### 1. Key Features:\n",
    "\n",
    "Model Selection: Choose between three architectures via --model argument\\\n",
    "Flexible Configuration: All training parameters are configurable via command line\\\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. Advanced Features:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Mixed precision training (for enhanced/attention models)\\\n",
    "- Multiple loss functions (BCE, Dice, Combined, Focal, Tversky)\\\n",
    "- Multiple optimizers (Adam, AdamW, SGD)\\\n",
    "- Multiple schedulers (Plateau, Cosine, Step)\\\n",
    "- Gradient clipping\\\n",
    "- Early stopping\\\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "Model Complexity Analysis: Automatically analyses and reports model parameters and size\\\n",
    "Comprehensive Logging: TensorBoard logging with metrics tracking\\\n",
    "Checkpoint Management: Saves best and latest model checkpoints\\\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3. Command Line Arguments:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model Architecture:** --model, --base_features, --encoder_dropout, --bottleneck_dropout\n",
    "\n",
    "**Training:** --learning_rate, --batch_size, --num_epochs, --weight_decay\n",
    "\n",
    "**Optimization:** --optimizer, --scheduler_type, --loss_type\n",
    "\n",
    "**Advanced:** --use_amp, --early_stopping, --gradient_clipping\n",
    "\n",
    "**Experiment:** --experiment_name\n",
    "\n",
    "The script automatically handles the differences between model types, applying advanced features like mixed precision only to models that support them, and providing appropriate default configurations for each architecture."
   ]
  },
